# Hosts that the packet filter NEVER touches (--hostlist-exclude).
# Empty by default: with no entries the aggressive strategies are
# allowlisted to dom.active (your "Additional domains") and the safe
# strategies run over all traffic.
# Add one host per line. Your own entries belong in dom.user (not touched
# by updates) or via the extension UI ("Additional domains to bypass");
# never-touch entries go to "Excluded domains" (exc.user).